  "Wine in the Night-Glow Cup": {
   "rule": "Night-Glow Blood Sabre Canon (passive art, layer 4, authored d19, a1): each 5 % of your maximum health you pay for arts or deal as Bleed fills the Night-Glow Cup by one, to five; a Broken foe fills it at once. At five you drink: your next art is free and heals you for 20 % of the health you paid since the last drink.",
   "approx": "Art health payments read exact `event.hp_paid_share`; Bleed ticks (`status: \"bleed\"`) advance the cup by 2 % of health per tick (`~1-2 Bleed stacks` at typical realm M) because `tick_dealt` carries raw HP rather than a `hp_max` share.",
